    "sections": {
        "description": "<ul>\n<li>Customer first name as a shortcode</li>\n<li>Email style inherited from WooCommerce email notifications</li>\n<li>Reminder interval</li>\n<li>Manual send</li>\n<li>Send log</li>\n<li>Debug log</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20set%20up%20styles%20and%20colors%3F'>\nHow do I set up styles and colors?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You don&#8217;t need to. The colors are already inherited from WooCommerce settings.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='test%20mail%20didn%27t%20come%20through'>\nTest mail didn&#8217;t come through\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The plugin uses same sending function (wp_mail) as the rest of the site. Make sure WooCommerce emails come through too. If not &#8211; review reminders won&#8217;t be sent as well. Check with your hosting.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='i%20need%20extra%20features%2C%20do%20you%20offer%20customization%20service%3F'>\nI need extra features, do you offer customization service?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Sure, just drop us a line at: support@morkva.co.ua</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WP 6.8 &#8211; compatible</li>\n<li>WooCommerce 9.8 &#8211; compatible</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>[new] change tags</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>WordPress 6.7 tested</li>\n<li>WooCommerce 9.4 tested</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "An item with one review is 65% more likely to be purchased than an item with no reviews. Send review reminder emails to your customers today.",
